Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "AnimalCrossingNight" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :description "A dog enters the vehicle path at night" .

:actor1 a :Obstacle ;
    :description "German Shepherd running into the street" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Collision risk with an animal on the road" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.92"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Potential collision with an animal (dog) suddenly entering the roadway during night conditions, creating a high-risk obstacle avoidance scenario.
